# 2. Verification of the history-independent tax solver No.2
run the history-dependent tax solver with `mu1 = mu2 = 1e-6` to verify that it reproduces the history-independent tax results almostexactly. This code is quantitatively similar to the previous code, but it uses a slightly nonzero value of `mu1` and `mu2` to verify that the history-dependent tax solver is robust to small perturbations in the tax parameters. 

result = run_history_dependent_tax(mu1=1e-6, mu2=1e-6,  labor_grid_size=101);

